    <!--
      Brand palette, dark.

      Not the light scheme inverted: the primary lightens to #4CDADA so it stays legible on dark
      surfaces, and containers darken so text on them keeps contrast. Surfaces are near-neutral
      with a slight teal cast rather than pure black, which stops the saturated tool-card colours
      from vibrating against the background on OLED screens.
    -->
